* The transit pod in the tube by the lab (openc2e Creatures 2 project, our
* own script). The pod (3 6 3) travels between its dock at the lab (left
* edge x 4550) and its far dock (right edge x 6170), moving sideways 20 px a
* tick and nudging itself 2 px up or down each tick to follow the tube; in
* openc2e that climbs 1 in 10 while the tube falls only about 1 in 38 (its
* top edge from y ~1432 at x 4760 to ~1478 at x 5950), so the pod left the
* tube and stopped about 100 px too high at the lab (owner, 2026-11-08).
* While it travels, this watcher (2 1 143, invisible) keeps it on a line
* parallel to the tube (its top edge, scanned every 40 px on engine
* snapshots: 1434 at x 4810 to 1490 at 5890, a steady 1 in 19, the bottom
* edge parallel), from the far dock's travel height (y 1455 at left edge
* 5914; it settles 20 px lower, at 1475, when it stops) to the lab dock (y
* 1384 at 4550, level with the tube's mouth). Earlier lines (1 in 38, then 1
* in 28 from two points) let the pod sag below the tube toward the lab
* (owner, 2026-11-09). The line now runs 4 px lower (it poked out of the
* tube's top; owner, 2026-11-09): y 1459 at left edge 5914, 1388 at the lab.
* Run by openc2e after the world loads (Additions folder); safe to repeat.
enum 2 2 214 kill targ next
enum 2 2 215 kill targ next
enum 2 1 143 kill targ next
enum 2 2 219 kill targ next
inst new: simp blnk 1 0 0 0 setv cls2 2 1 143 setv attr 16 mvto 5000 1300 tick 1 slow
scrp 2 1 143 9
  inst
  enum 3 6 3
    doif velx ne 0
      setv var0 posl
      setv var1 posl subv var1 5914 mulv var1 520 divv var1 10000 addv var1 1459
      mvto var0 var1
    endi
  next
endm

* The lab starts powered (owner, 2026-11-09). The lab's power switch (3 10
* 11, left of the dock) starts the lab's machines (3 10 8-10), enables the
* pod's dock button (2 2 22, OV00) and the lab console (2 2 21, OV01). The
* first time, it also moves the camera to the lab and shows a message, unless
* the console's OV02 is already 1; we set that first so the start is quiet,
* then press the switch.
enum 2 2 21 setv ov02 1 next
enum 3 10 11 doif ov00 eq 0 mesg writ targ 0 endi next

* The pod's trips, rewritten (owner, 2026-11-09): at the far dock it eased
* down to rest when it arrived and rose before it left; now it does the same
* at the lab (the domed room), settling 20 px into the dock there (rest y
* 1408) and rising 20 px before it sets off. At the far dock it settles 16 px
* (rest y 1475, as before). OV00 is where it is: 0 the lab, 1 the far dock.
* On arrival it sets its riders down and nudges them out of the doorway.
* Activate 1: from the lab to the far dock.
scrp 3 6 3 1
  doif ov00 eq 0
    subv attr 4
    part 1 anim [210] wait 10
    gpas
    part 1 anim [012]
    reps 10 mvby 0 -2 wait 1 repe
    part 1 anim [23456R]
    setv velx 20 sndl shut
    loop wait 1 untl posr ge 6170
    fade setv velx 0
    setv var0 5950 subv var0 posl mvby var0 0
    part 1 pose 6
    reps 8 mvby 0 2 wait 1 repe
    part 1 anim [89]
    dps2 0 wait 10
    etch 4 0 0 setv velx 80 setv vely -20 next
    targ ownr wait 5 part 1 anim [987]
    addv attr 4 setv ov00 1
  endi
  setv actv 0
endm

* Activate 2: from the far dock to the lab.
scrp 3 6 3 2
  doif ov00 eq 1
    subv attr 4
    part 1 anim [89] wait 10
    gpas
    part 1 anim [986]
    reps 8 mvby 0 -2 wait 1 repe
    part 1 anim [65432R]
    setv velx -20 sndl shut
    loop wait 1 untl posl le 4550
    fade setv velx 0
    part 1 pose 2
    reps 10 mvby 0 2 wait 1 repe
    part 1 anim [10]
    dps2 0 wait 10
    etch 4 0 0 setv velx -80 setv vely -20 next
    targ ownr wait 5 part 1 anim [017]
    addv attr 4 setv ov00 0
  endi
  setv actv 0
endm

* A caller at the far dock (owner, 2026-11-09): the lab has one on its dock
* (2 2 22); this one (2 2 219, the lab lift's caller picture zlbt) stands on
* the machine room's floor (room 159, y 1798) just right of the tube's end,
* and brings the pod over from the lab while the lab is powered (the lab's
* dock button enabled, its OV00).
scrp 2 2 219 1
  pose 1 snde ding
  setv var0 0
  enum 2 2 22 setv var0 ov00 next
  doif var0 ne 0
    enum 3 6 3 doif ov00 eq 0 doif velx eq 0 mesg writ targ 0 endi endi next
  endi
  part 0 wait 30 pose 0 setv actv 0
endm

scrp 2 2 219 2
  pose 1 snde ding
  setv var0 0
  enum 2 2 22 setv var0 ov00 next
  doif var0 ne 0
    enum 3 6 3 doif ov00 eq 0 doif velx eq 0 mesg writ targ 0 endi endi next
  endi
  part 0 wait 30 pose 0 setv actv 0
endm

inst new: simp zlbt 2 0 1300 0 setv cls2 2 2 219 setv attr 4 bhvr 2 0 pose 0 mvto 6123 1723 slow
